#DOGE vs. Dogecoin: Musk puts an end to the confusion

@elonmusk confirmed that the Department of Government Efficiency (DOGE) is not associated with Dogecoin.

Despite this, a brief appearance of the @dogecoin logo on the agency’s website in February led to a 14% spike. https://t.co/5dMh2ZnI8A
